Rāvaṇa marches to Kailāsa with six ministers --- Yakṣa guards win leave and clash --- Ministers rout thousands each --- Rāvaṇa burns Yakṣa host with mace --- Fallen Yakṣas bite lips and huddle weaponless --- Saṃyōdhakaṇṭaka fells Mārīca then flees counterattack --- Sūryabhānu blocks Rāvaṇa at gate --- Rāvaṇa endures tōraṇa blow by Brahmā boon --- Rāvaṇa kills guardian and scatters Yakṣas to rivers and caves
